Expressing grave concern at the impact of the conflict in Sudan on the stability and humanitarian situation in South Sudan, including cross-border displacement and reports of arms flows, while stressing the need for verifiable information on cross-border movements, and calling for respect for the sovereignty and territorial integrity of South Sudan and the Sudan,
